  .demo figcaption b { color: var(--navy-900); font-weight: 600; }

  /* ── Narrow ──
     Two columns and four cards. Five would need a third row, and a third row
     does not fit the taller-but-shorter phone frame — the row holding the match
     would be clipped at the bottom edge, which is the one card that has to be
     visible. Dropping card 4 as well leaves 1, 2, 3 and the match, so the match
